WEBVTT

00:20.580 --> 00:24.000
I'm hungry! Yoshino!

00:25.910 --> 00:27.500
Yoshino?

00:31.620 --> 00:33.220
Yoshino?

00:35.430 --> 00:38.180
Yoshino? Are you not here?

00:39.330 --> 00:41.060
That's strange.

00:44.560 --> 00:47.580
Hey, Narino. Do you know where Yoshino is?

00:47.580 --> 00:48.990
What's wrong?

00:48.990 --> 00:51.360
I got hungry right before 
I was supposed to leave,

00:51.360 --> 00:54.000
so I thought I'd have her make me something.

00:54.000 --> 00:56.610
My sister went out shopping.

00:56.920 --> 00:59.500
Shopping? That's strange.

00:59.500 --> 01:02.080
Did I ask her to get me something?

01:02.080 --> 01:05.530
No, I asked her to get something.

01:05.950 --> 01:09.290
And I told her to buy something
for herself, too.

01:09.790 --> 01:11.250
I see.

01:14.620 --> 01:20.190
Otherwise, she'd never do 
anything for herself,

01:20.190 --> 01:22.310
considering she's stuck in errand girl mode.

02:53.060 --> 02:59.030
<b>#8 "There Are Things You Shouldn't Realize"</b>

02:54.370 --> 02:55.820
Pig's Foot...

03:04.500 --> 03:05.770
Master...

03:07.950 --> 03:09.910
<b>Grapel</b>

03:09.910 --> 03:11.120
Well...

03:12.120 --> 03:14.080
Bye.

03:15.500 --> 03:16.910
Ow!

03:16.910 --> 03:18.460
Are you hurt?

03:18.840 --> 03:21.840
The biggest blunder of my life...

03:21.840 --> 03:24.680
What nonsense are you going on about?

03:24.970 --> 03:27.430
You sprained your ankle, didn't you?

03:31.100 --> 03:33.100
I'm fine.

03:33.100 --> 03:34.810
Anyway, this isn't the best place.

03:35.080 --> 03:36.240
Let's go somewhere else.

03:41.700 --> 03:43.980
Why do you have brass knuckles?!

03:44.910 --> 03:47.870
I can't hold back when my life is in danger.

03:47.870 --> 03:50.250
Why are you saying that
with such a serious face?!

03:50.250 --> 03:52.060
Well, can you move, then?!

03:57.160 --> 03:58.700
She moves like she's ancient.

04:09.280 --> 04:11.640
See? You can't walk, right?

04:17.480 --> 04:20.230
At least make it a piggyback ride...

04:23.240 --> 04:25.190
That's what this was about?

04:31.790 --> 04:34.940
Aki-sama's late...

04:34.940 --> 04:40.590
Last time, Aki-sama canceled
because she said something came up.

04:40.590 --> 04:46.020
Yes. This social gathering between
Aki-sama and us, her bodyguards...

04:46.530 --> 04:52.060
has been either canceled or 
delayed three times out of five.

04:53.370 --> 04:55.770
And they're all due to that incident!

04:55.770 --> 05:00.020
Ever since rumors started going around about
Aki-sama going out with Makabe Masamune!

05:01.360 --> 05:04.120
Rumors... about them going out?

05:04.120 --> 05:10.840
A-A moment, please. I'm not sure
if "rumor" is quite the right word...

05:10.840 --> 05:12.350
I called it a rumor because it <i>is</i> a rumor!

05:12.350 --> 05:15.000
It's basically an urban legend!

05:15.000 --> 05:17.830
I'd rather not admit it myself...

05:18.580 --> 05:23.170
But it is a known fact that Aki-sama
and Makabe Masamune are dating.

05:23.170 --> 05:25.130
I won't accept it!

05:25.130 --> 05:27.130
You need to face reality!

05:27.130 --> 05:29.850
But I don't wanna!

05:29.850 --> 05:34.350
It's a rumor! It's just a rumor, 
dang it! Aki-sama!

05:30.070 --> 05:34.350
Hang on a sec! No good is going 
to come of us fighting over this!

05:40.940 --> 05:44.620
Today's just gonna have to 
be the day we ask Aki-sama

05:44.620 --> 05:49.110
how the hell she ended up going out
with that Makabe Masamune!

05:49.110 --> 05:52.760
I still believe in the theory
that Makabe's tricking her!

05:52.760 --> 05:54.760
Well, of course he is!

05:54.760 --> 05:56.840
B-But...

05:58.980 --> 06:02.920
If there's just a slight chance...
no, even a sliver of a chance

06:03.470 --> 06:08.360
that Aki-sama really has feelings
for Makabe Masamune...

06:11.280 --> 06:14.010
If she does?

06:14.010 --> 06:20.980
Perhaps she may think us worrying about her
is nothing more than a nuisance, and...

06:25.020 --> 06:28.120
Then... Then what are we supposed to do?!

06:28.120 --> 06:30.510
Oh, yeah! Ever since it was reported

06:30.510 --> 06:33.440
at the end of last year that 
Aki-sama was going out with Makabe,

06:33.440 --> 06:36.780
she's never given us a proper explanation!

06:37.360 --> 06:40.460
To be honest, I have no idea

06:41.040 --> 06:42.920
how we should even approach this.

06:46.370 --> 06:48.730
Sorry to keep you waiting.

06:50.080 --> 06:52.160
A-Aki-sama...

06:52.160 --> 06:54.890
Um, er...

06:56.350 --> 07:02.310
Y-You look... radiant... today...

07:13.840 --> 07:16.410
<i>People keep staring at us.</i>

07:17.920 --> 07:19.480
<i>But more importantly...</i>

07:23.350 --> 07:24.350
Am I heavy?

07:24.350 --> 07:26.090
No, not really!

07:26.090 --> 07:28.800
<i>She'd kill me for saying this, but...</i>

07:28.800 --> 07:32.310
<i>Her boobs are squished
so tight against my back...</i>

07:33.580 --> 07:37.470
<i>She'd just snap my neck like... "crack."</i>

07:37.470 --> 07:40.180
<i>Master can get pretty violent at times...</i>

07:41.370 --> 07:44.340
<i>But this weight and sensation...</i>

07:45.020 --> 07:48.650
<i>No, no, no! If she ever found out 
I was worried about that...</i>

07:49.000 --> 07:50.150
Pig's Foot.

07:50.150 --> 07:52.610
<i>Did she figure me out?! I'm gonna die!</i>

07:52.920 --> 07:54.460
You can put me down.

07:55.340 --> 07:59.620
There's a park over there.
I'll be fine if I rest there.

08:01.440 --> 08:02.830
<i>Oh...</i>

08:02.830 --> 08:05.250
What are you talking about?
You don't need to be—

08:05.250 --> 08:08.030
I'm wearing a skirt, and 
people might see my panties!

08:09.510 --> 08:12.160
Okay, we can go over there.

08:12.160 --> 08:13.760
Make it extra quick.

08:14.260 --> 08:16.600
<i>This whole time, I was
worried about her boobs,</i>

08:16.600 --> 08:18.940
<i>and she was worried about
something completely different...</i>

08:29.560 --> 08:31.210
I'm sorry, everyone.

08:31.210 --> 08:34.280
I haven't been able to match my 
schedule with all of yours lately.

08:34.280 --> 08:35.530
I-It's okay...

08:35.530 --> 08:37.630
W-We're not worried about that.

08:37.630 --> 08:41.290
Y-You needn't worry about us.

08:47.140 --> 08:49.250
Hey, ask her the question already.

08:49.560 --> 08:53.720
Me?! But I can't!

08:58.050 --> 08:59.640
Oh, fine.

09:00.680 --> 09:04.800
Um, so... Aki-sama...

09:04.800 --> 09:05.760
Yes?

09:05.760 --> 09:08.400
How are things going for you lately?

09:08.400 --> 09:09.360
What things?

09:09.360 --> 09:13.690
You know... Are you...

09:13.690 --> 09:16.820
enjoying the sweet life?

09:16.820 --> 09:17.960
Sweet?

09:17.960 --> 09:21.770
Oh, you mean sweets?
Yeah, I've been eating them quite often.

09:26.360 --> 09:28.920
You didn't get through to her at all!

09:28.920 --> 09:32.000
This is the best I can do.

09:37.670 --> 09:39.180
Very well...

09:39.180 --> 09:41.800
A-Aki-sama...

09:41.800 --> 09:42.940
Yes?

09:43.420 --> 09:49.110
Is... Is... your...

09:50.400 --> 09:52.470
Isn't the moon lovely?!

09:53.240 --> 09:54.780
It's the middle of the day.

09:56.040 --> 09:58.510
<i>I-I'm sunk...</i>

09:58.510 --> 10:00.870
<i>Private Mizuno!</i>

10:01.240 --> 10:05.610
Hey, what's going on?
You're all acting strange today.

10:08.630 --> 10:10.830
Did something happen?

10:13.550 --> 10:15.170
Wh-What the...

10:16.150 --> 10:19.940
We want to know how you really feel!

10:20.400 --> 10:23.010
How I... really feel?

10:23.010 --> 10:26.980
Are you really going out
with Makabe Masamune?!

10:27.310 --> 10:28.690
<i>She said it!</i>

10:28.690 --> 10:32.150
<i>Even through her panic, she managed 
an attack right to the core!</i>

10:38.110 --> 10:41.800
Well... yes...

10:42.910 --> 10:44.030
<i>That's...</i>

10:44.030 --> 10:47.250
<i>The embarrassed face a girl
makes when she's in love.</i>

10:47.250 --> 10:50.980
<i>I never thought I'd see
Aki-sama make this face.</i>

10:51.780 --> 10:53.350
<i>I hate to admit it, but...</i>

10:54.960 --> 10:57.960
<i>I love this side of her, too!</i>

11:02.070 --> 11:04.460
There we go.

11:08.930 --> 11:10.520
Are you okay?

11:10.520 --> 11:12.480
You don't need to touch me!

11:12.480 --> 11:13.770
Okay, okay.

11:20.660 --> 11:23.530
<i>I haven't seen her in so long,
and she treats me like this...</i>

11:23.530 --> 11:26.090
<i>She really doesn't back off.</i>

11:28.470 --> 11:29.960
The birthday date...

11:31.330 --> 11:33.180
You chased Aki-sama away?

11:34.220 --> 11:37.120
<i>The one thing I really didn't want 
her to ask me about right now!</i>

11:37.120 --> 11:38.380
<i>Play it off!</i>

11:38.850 --> 11:42.190
D-Don't make it sound so bad!

11:42.190 --> 11:46.100
We just wrapped things up
a bit earlier than planned!

11:46.100 --> 11:49.440
You know, the fact that I wasn't
so pushy makes me a gentleman,

11:49.440 --> 11:53.780
and most girls would think, "Wow, how 
lovely!" and my likability would go up.

11:54.440 --> 11:56.060
Don't give me that.

11:56.430 --> 11:58.840
Aki-sama's super depressed right now.

12:02.120 --> 12:04.390
<i>Well, I think it's weird, too.</i>

12:06.350 --> 12:10.150
<i>But... my body's not cooperating.</i>

12:11.330 --> 12:12.640
Ow!

12:12.640 --> 12:16.670
Can you promise me you'll throw her
onto the bed the next time you see her?

12:16.670 --> 12:19.420
I absolutely cannot!

12:19.420 --> 12:21.700
How are you so pathetic?

12:19.420 --> 12:24.090
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

12:27.860 --> 12:29.210
Pig's Foot?

12:33.440 --> 12:34.870
<i>Could it be...</i>

12:36.680 --> 12:38.060
Pardon me a sec.

12:53.720 --> 12:54.960
Pig's Foo—

13:14.280 --> 13:18.900
I was right. With you, it's okay.

13:20.020 --> 13:23.290
I never should've gone out with her.

13:23.920 --> 13:28.550
I think I had the most fun when 
I was devising my plan with you.

13:30.370 --> 13:31.320
Master?

13:39.710 --> 13:43.710
We want to know how you really feel!

13:44.560 --> 13:48.680
Well, so do I...

13:53.140 --> 13:54.140
Aki-chan?

13:58.480 --> 13:59.820
Kanetsugu?

13:59.820 --> 14:02.320
It's... been a while.

14:03.170 --> 14:04.520
Yeah...

14:05.660 --> 14:09.770
Do you... have a second?

14:11.600 --> 14:12.520
Sure...

14:15.380 --> 14:17.450
Ow!

14:17.450 --> 14:20.210
Why'd she headbutt me all of a sudden?

14:20.700 --> 14:21.500
Huh?

14:23.650 --> 14:25.630
Where'd she go?

14:25.630 --> 14:27.480
She can't walk on that leg.

14:28.340 --> 14:33.310
<b>I'll pretend you
never said that</b>

14:33.690 --> 14:37.210
<i>She's right. I shouldn't have said that.</i>

14:38.160 --> 14:40.120
<i>For Adagaki-san's sake...</i>

14:40.730 --> 14:42.760
<i>And for Master's sake.</i>

14:44.010 --> 14:45.900
<i>How stupid am I?</i>

14:46.770 --> 14:51.110
<i>No matter how much I regret it,
I can't take it back now.</i>

14:54.660 --> 14:56.330
I was pretty surprised.

14:56.330 --> 14:59.880
I never would've thought 
I'd run into you out there.

14:59.880 --> 15:01.290
Yeah.

15:02.050 --> 15:05.500
I think this is the first time
we've talked since that incident.

15:05.950 --> 15:06.780
Yeah.

15:08.970 --> 15:10.190
Kanetsugu?!

15:10.190 --> 15:13.040
Aki-chan, I'm so sorry!

15:13.040 --> 15:15.930
I'm not expecting you to completely forgive me.

15:16.330 --> 15:18.220
But I...

15:19.240 --> 15:21.140
Lift your head, please.

15:23.030 --> 15:24.990
I heard the details.

15:24.990 --> 15:27.570
You've basically worked things 
out with my father, right?

15:28.340 --> 15:29.210
Yeah...

15:30.180 --> 15:33.470
So your sister's in the hospital?

15:33.470 --> 15:35.960
And you needed money for that.

15:37.510 --> 15:42.840
Don't get the wrong idea. 
There's nothing to forgive. I'm not even mad.

15:42.840 --> 15:46.760
But it's still true that I was
lying to you that whole time.

15:47.510 --> 15:52.250
It's also true that it's been weighing 
on your mind and you regret it, right?

15:52.250 --> 15:55.140
I know that because that's 
the kind of person you are.

15:57.600 --> 16:01.770
Besides, it's all in the past now.

16:06.630 --> 16:09.450
You're so strong, Aki-chan.

16:10.530 --> 16:12.730
No, I'm not.

16:13.820 --> 16:16.330
You had something you wanted
to protect, even if it meant

16:16.330 --> 16:18.180
making some sacrifices
with those around you.

16:18.680 --> 16:21.620
You did all that because 
you had the resolve, right?

16:22.990 --> 16:25.000
But I'm different.

16:25.660 --> 16:29.790
I had no idea I'd been hurting
a certain someone...

16:29.790 --> 16:31.170
apparently.

16:33.170 --> 16:35.200
I'm going to get revenge
on that woman!!

16:35.610 --> 16:38.890
Even though I know that now,
I can't do anything.

16:39.730 --> 16:42.660
I can't even be brave enough
to accept that fact.

16:45.250 --> 16:47.160
I'm not strong at all.

16:48.480 --> 16:52.060
This certain someone...
Are you talking about...

16:52.060 --> 16:53.570
Makabe-kun?

16:55.030 --> 16:58.640
Aki-chan, you're dating Makabe-kun, right?

16:58.640 --> 17:04.150
I didn't think you two would actually
start dating after that confession.

17:07.610 --> 17:10.720
I know it's going to be hard to
convince you, considering

17:10.720 --> 17:12.920
I'd been lying to you that whole time...

17:13.290 --> 17:17.430
But because I'd been lying
that whole time, I can say this.

17:18.190 --> 17:21.850
The one thing you can't do
is lie to your own heart.

17:23.320 --> 17:26.310
Lie to my own heart?

17:26.790 --> 17:28.520
All this time...

17:29.140 --> 17:33.230
I thought that maintaining the Gasou
family's financial power and status

17:33.230 --> 17:35.950
was the way to protect my family.

17:33.990 --> 17:35.950
<b>gaki Group</b>

17:33.990 --> 17:35.950
<b>Secretary</b>

17:36.710 --> 17:40.740
I'd convinced myself that I had to 
do whatever it took to do that.

17:41.570 --> 17:45.500
But all I was doing was lying
to myself that whole time.

17:46.160 --> 17:48.460
When you all found out everything,

17:48.460 --> 17:54.500
it became clear to me that my family's 
financial power and status meant nothing.

17:55.410 --> 18:00.090
The one thing that mattered to 
me was my little sister's smile.

18:01.680 --> 18:04.220
Everything I did was for my sister.

18:04.220 --> 18:08.900
When I realized that, I figured out 
what I really wanted to do.

18:08.900 --> 18:10.660
So, right now...

18:11.880 --> 18:14.120
I feel really refreshed.

18:15.380 --> 18:16.980
I see...

18:17.830 --> 18:21.320
Are you able to accept 
your feelings right now?

18:22.800 --> 18:25.580
My... feelings?

18:25.580 --> 18:28.790
You can't end up like me.

18:41.560 --> 18:46.920
<i>Accept... my feelings...</i>

18:58.850 --> 19:01.420
I get it. I...

19:12.260 --> 19:14.170
Welcome home, Yoshino.

19:15.310 --> 19:17.100
I heard you went shopping.

19:17.760 --> 19:20.470
Well? Did you find anything nice?

19:20.470 --> 19:22.620
No, I...

19:23.430 --> 19:26.140
<b>Yoronpas</b>

19:23.430 --> 19:26.140
<b>Tape</b>

19:23.430 --> 19:26.140
<b>Includes 6</b>

19:23.430 --> 19:26.140
<b>Ointment</b>

19:23.430 --> 19:26.140
Nikixin

19:23.430 --> 19:26.140
<b>Keshiro</b>

19:23.430 --> 19:26.140
<b>Patappu – Pills</b>

19:23.950 --> 19:26.140
What? The first-aid kit?

19:26.710 --> 19:28.800
I twisted my ankle.

19:28.800 --> 19:31.600
Wait, you sprained it?! That's no good!

19:31.600 --> 19:34.310
Honestly, you're such a klutz.

19:34.310 --> 19:37.160
Here, have a seat. I'll treat you.

19:37.890 --> 19:39.400
I'm fine...

19:39.400 --> 19:40.780
Just sit already.

19:41.210 --> 19:42.340
Ow!

19:47.200 --> 19:49.930
This is really bad...

19:49.930 --> 19:52.170
I'm honestly pretty surprised myself.

19:52.170 --> 19:54.700
How did you even walk home like this?

19:54.700 --> 19:55.880
Perseverance!

19:55.880 --> 19:56.920
What?!

19:57.740 --> 19:59.840
Anyway, all we can do now is ice it.

20:00.470 --> 20:03.160
Make sure you go to the hospital tomorrow.

20:03.160 --> 20:04.300
Okay.

20:06.040 --> 20:08.720
Aki-sama, thank you very much.

20:09.100 --> 20:12.940
What are you talking about?
Anyone would do this much.

20:17.600 --> 20:19.340
<i>Would they, though?</i>

20:20.070 --> 20:23.690
<i>I'm a traitorous witch.</i>

20:25.720 --> 20:27.830
<i>Even what happened today...</i>

20:32.480 --> 20:33.740
Yoshino?

20:34.800 --> 20:35.580
<i>No...</i>

20:36.530 --> 20:38.540
<i>No, no, no...</i>

20:39.750 --> 20:44.380
I think I had the most fun when 
I was devising my plan with you.

20:45.830 --> 20:48.520
<i>This absolutely cannot happen...</i>

20:49.500 --> 20:52.300
<i>Why would you say
something like that, you idiot?</i>

22:23.990 --> 22:25.450
Morning!

22:25.450 --> 22:26.780
Morning!

22:34.420 --> 22:36.830
Morning, Makabe-kun.

22:36.830 --> 22:39.420
H-Hey... Morning.

22:42.420 --> 22:43.270
Huh?

22:43.270 --> 22:44.410
What?

22:44.410 --> 22:47.380
Oh, I just realized you're by yourself today.

22:47.380 --> 22:49.310
By myself? What are you—

22:49.310 --> 22:50.360
Oh, no!

22:50.360 --> 22:53.100
I'm on duty in class today,
so I have to get there early!

22:53.100 --> 22:54.920
I'll see you later!

22:56.200 --> 22:58.380
You sure are busy bright and early.

23:01.220 --> 23:02.440
That's a big yawn.

23:03.390 --> 23:04.660
Koiwai-san.

23:05.820 --> 23:08.280
Don't call me that.

23:10.110 --> 23:12.700
You're supposed to call me Yoshino, remember?

23:14.660 --> 23:17.030
<i>Th-This is...</i>

23:17.620 --> 23:21.430
<i>This isn't right!</i>

23:28.470 --> 23:30.510
A dream?

23:33.650 --> 23:35.850
<i>I think there are some feelings</i>

23:35.850 --> 23:39.540
<i>that you should really never accept.</i>
